<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0682_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Josh</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0682_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It was fun scrappin’ you!\nI’d LOVE to swap numbers, please?\fI’d do ANYTHING. I’d sell a kidney.\fC’mon, let’s swap numbers! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0682_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks! Let’s scrap again sometime!\rJust hit me when you ready.\nI’ll answer on the first ring. ALWAYS.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0682_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ULP!\rYou sayin’ I’m so weak I ain’t even\nworth scrappin’?\fI’m gon’ go lay in the street.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0682_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’d do ANYTHING to get your\nnumber!\rPlease, let’s swap numbers! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0682_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh yeah.\nThis a Shiny Stone.\rIt’s aight, don’t be shy!\nIt’s worth a MILLION dollars. Maybe.\fTake it. Go ’head!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0682_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? Somethin’ off about your\nvoice... Don’t tell me... You\fstandin’ right nearby, ain’t you?\rIf you already this close,\nwhy not come talk in person?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0682_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m still a lightweight, as usual...\rMy day one, {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}, is grindin’\nhard!\rIt knocked out a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} in under two\nseconds in a scrap!\rOK, OK, two seconds is a lil cap...\nIt was five minutes and 37 seconds...\fAnd I helped. With a stick.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0682_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} got pretty strong!\rBut this {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} it was scrappin’\ndipped before the fight was over...\rThat was {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}’s fault, right?\rIt was MY fault?\nI guess that’s possible! Unlikely!\fBut possible!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0682_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Earlier, I was deep in thought\nwhile walkin’...\rOutta nowhere this {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} jumped out!\rI was pretty shook, and then it\ndipped!\rThinkin’ about it, I had made\nplans to trade with a homie, so I was\flookin’ for a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}...\rThat’s too bad...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0682_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Where you at now? I’m always on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0} myself.\rWhat you think about scrappin’ me\nagain? Sound like a good idea?\fI’ll be waitin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0682_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\nDon’t forget!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0682_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ah... Ah... ACHOO!\rAh... Ah... Ah... ACHOO!\rIt’s nothin’. My bird homie flappin’ its\nwings, so there’s dust EVERYWHERE...\fI’m DYIN’. I’m deathly allergic.\fNot deadass. But it FEELS like it.\rACHOOOO!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0682_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My homie had somethin’ in its mouth\nrecently.\rI pulled it out... A Shiny Stone!\fI SCREAMED. The neighbors called the\fcops.\r...But what IS a Shiny Stone?\rNo clue what it’s worth, so I’ll just\ngive it to you!\rI’ll wait for you on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\nCome get it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0682_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You want a Shiny Stone, right?\nI’m on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}. Come get it!</language>
	</row>
</body>
